  "name": "shellspiel",
  "description": "shellspiel is a real-time artillery game that leverages a hybrid engine composed of Rust-based cellular automata and WebGL-driven fluid simulations. The core simulation logic is compiled to WebAssembly for high-performance particle updates, while the rendering pipeline utilizes fragment shaders and the REGL library for efficient GPGPU computations. The architecture integrates a React-based user interface with a Firebase backend to support social features and persistent user-generated content.",
